 the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and February to March came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those 75 years. In 2025 that pair hit 45% of normal, while September to October ran 198%. So far in 2026, February to March sits at 15% and March to April at 41%. Grid 22629 had its driest year in 1956 at 50%.</p>"}
